SUMMARY:FirstCheck: Smart Angels Do Smart Deals (Online Only)
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/6qr1fm8g​ \nThis is the class where you stop learning about investing and start operating like a Smart Angel Investor. \nYou’ll learn how disciplined investors evaluate opportunities and begin making your own invest-or-pass decisions. After this course\, you’ll have structured evaluation criteria\, the ability to justify a decision\, and the beginning of an investor’s discipline.
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/firstcheck-smart-angels-do-smart-deals-2/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Angel-Investing-101-Valuation-and-Term-Sheets.jpg?ver=1783560406
END:VEVENT
