SUMMARY:⭕️Cybersecurity Circle⭕️
DESCRIPTION:Our mission is to DEFEAT CYBER CRIMINALS by making cybersecurity knowledge accessible and relatable to everyone. This event creates a supportive environment for individuals starting their cybersecurity journey\, those transitioning into the field\, and professionals navigating job transitions—including those rebuilding confidence after layoffs. Together\, we strengthen our collective defense against cyber threats while fostering career growth and community connections.\nThe ⭕️Cybersecurity Circle⭕️ unites practitioners of all levels in an inclusive community committed to defeating cybercrime through shared knowledge\, collaboration\, and continuous learning. Together\, we’re securing our digital world—one hack at a time
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/%e2%ad%95%ef%b8%8fcybersecurity-circle%e2%ad%95%ef%b8%8f-25/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/⭕️CYBERSECURITY-CIRCLE⭕️.png?ver=1767643977
END:VEVENT
